2. The behavior:
   - The height `node.position.y` when `startHover` is called is the rest height
   - The bob starts immediately on the manager
   - Each second: rises at steady rate to 0.5 above rest over half a second, comes back down to rest over the next half second, repeats
   - The returned function sets strength (0 to 1, starts at 1)
   - At strength s, the bob rises only s × 0.5 above rest, on the same rhythm
   - At strength 0, the pickup sits still at rest
